\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {27}{\ignorespaces Reproduction time against the 4~s per character limit of R3. Left: synthesis time per character against sentence length for four values of the number of candidates. At best-of-1 and best-of-3 the synthesis alone is comfortably inside the limit; at best-of-30 it approaches and crosses it. Right: total time per character at best-of-14, decomposed into synthesis, G-code generation and the physical writing time predicted by the generator's model. The writing term, not the synthesis term, is the larger contributor and is what pushes the total past the limit.}}{61}{figure.caption.47}\protected@file@percent }
